is also the frontrunner for the Republican

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:19.889
nomination for president and you listen to
Republicans who were asked about this yesterday

00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:25.180
and some version of what we heard for six
years prior, don't want to talk about it,

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:28.000
