the process.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:32.120
How do you kind of reconcile that moment,
I guess?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.659
&gt;&gt; Here is how.

00:04:33.659 --> 00:04:40.380
Yesterday the old view of what the perfect
victim looks like totally changed.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.389
&gt;&gt; What do you mean?

00:04:41.389 --> 00:04:48.360
&gt;&gt; The old view of the perfect victim was
a woman who always screamed, a woman who immediately

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:54.699
