00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.360
That was just shut down with this verdict.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.460
[8:28:03 AM]

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.550
this verdict.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:06.540
The death of the perfect victim has happened.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:12.820
Now this verdict is for all women.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.070
This is not really about me.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:18.110
It's for every single woman.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:23.110
&gt;&gt; In the courtroom there was an encounter,
