00:05:48.651 --> 00:05:51.991
And then we shook hands and I passed on.

00:05:51.991 --> 00:05:54.050
&gt;&gt; Did he say anything in response?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.289
&gt;&gt; No.

00:05:55.289 --> 00:05:56.990
He is a hail fellow well met.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.870
He went on shaking hands and smiling.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:05:59.919
[8:29:08 AM]

00:05:59.919 --> 00:06:00.919
