00:06:21.389 --> 00:06:23.110
&gt;&gt; There are no words.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.130
There are no words.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.520
I just now saw the headlines.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:40.240
I am really sort of taking in the moment and
overwhelming flood of a lot of hate.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.520
That's part of it.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:55.080
But overwhelming amount of relief and joy
