00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.550
&gt;&gt; What about appeals?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.860
We heard the president say they will appeal.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:21.960
Our Paula Reid with her brilliant legal analysis
