00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.370
I just would have loved it.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.370
[8:31:11 AM]

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:07.020
I just would have loved it.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:12.199
