However, I think he was frightened.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.050
I think he was frightened.

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.550
I think he was frightened of her.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:24.669
&gt;&gt; What's next?

00:08:24.669 --> 00:08:25.990
This has to be an all-consuming
--

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:31.569
&gt;&gt; I am going to get a dog for my dog because
I have been -- so he needs somebody to play

00:08:31.569 --> 00:08:32.569
